==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Alpacky]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of Metal Doges with Alpacky make for a surprising challenge, as these enemies cover each-other's weaknesses. In this stage, Metal Doge acts as a wall that protects Alpacky from your rushers and tankers, and Alpacky's high range and damage make it difficult for your critters to land hits on metal doge when covered.

Reliable Critters like Hurricat and Catasaurus will do well here for clearing the Metal Doges whenever he gets in front of and shield Alpacky, provided you lure them outside of her range, where your Citters would be obliterated. Cycle Tankers like Crazed M. Titan Cat and Jamiera Cat between the metal doge cycles to Whittle down and defeat Alpacky. Attack/ Defence Up Cat Combos can help you get more value from your Tankers here too.
When Alpacky's guaranteed survive a lethal strike is triggered, finish the job with a rusher like Manic Lion Cat or the Cat Cannon, after which the stage is effectively won.

